+   NativeCaller snapshots current before the innermost C-function/data or
+   optimized iterator entry, and remains that invocation's snapshot across JS
+   reentry. It is not the native dispatch argument or a generic caller query.
+   Both borrow without allocation/exception access, and return null without
+   explicit settings. NativeCaller also returns null outside native dispatch.
